Usage: gccli training coach-join --name=FREE-TEXT --end=DATE --day=DAY,... <id> [flags]

Start a Garmin Coach plan from a template.

Arguments:
  <id>    Catalog ID of a Garmin Coach template, as training search --category
          FBT_ADAPTIVE prints it.

Flags:
  -h, --help                Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain               Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header              Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                            output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"        Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING      Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"        Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                            elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                            auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us,
                            statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version             Print version information.

      --name=FREE-TEXT      Name of the new plan.
      --end=DATE            Last day of the plan (YYYY-MM-DD, today, yesterday,
                            3d, +30d).
      --day=DAY,...         Training day: MONDAY to SUNDAY. Repeat the flag
                            or separate with commas. Each coach template sets
                            how many days it needs, and Garmin rejects another
                            number.
      --long-day=DAY,...    Day for the long workout: MONDAY to SUNDAY. Repeat
                            the flag or separate with commas.
      --locale="en"         Locale for workout names (e.g. en, de, fr).

